<p>The concept itself is interesting. However, even in the document proper, it is somewhat unclear what exactly is going on. There is confusion between the subject and the SCP in multiple instances, and the &quot;feeding&quot; part is not elaborated on at all, among other issues.</p>
<p>The stuff between the SCP itself has no reason to be here in-universe. Why would the Foundation store this SCP like this in their database? Format Screws shouldn't be used willy-nilly like this without any justification.</p>
<p>I'm giving this one a downvote until it's edited to a higher standard. It has potential, but as it stands it just really needs to be rewritten.</p>

